    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-17.t01",
      "en": "We will investigate the complaint and respond by Friday.",
      "es": "Investigaremos la queja y responderemos antes del viernes.",
      "explanationEs": "Investigate y respond son verbos latinos: suenan formales en una empresa.",
